id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l008","ordinal":342504,"en":"When will I see my mother?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l009","ordinal":342505,"en":"bound to the magician,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l010","ordinal":342506,"en":"Without passing through the black cave,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l011","ordinal":342507,"en":"Unable to find the population,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l012","ordinal":342508,"en":"From the wild boar,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l013","ordinal":342509,"en":"A berry-like pea,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l014","ordinal":342510,"en":"In the cage of the treasure,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l015","ordinal":342511,"en":"I was tied up for thirteen years."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l016","ordinal":342512,"en":"A blue necklace is in the girl's hand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l017","ordinal":342513,"en":"While doing so,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l018","ordinal":342514,"en":"Is my bone loose?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l019","ordinal":342515,"en":"Has the cave reached its age?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l020","ordinal":342516,"en":"Your wrestling partner,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l021","ordinal":342517,"en":"Your bravery,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l022","ordinal":342518,"en":"Did my hand fall off?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l023","ordinal":342519,"en":"Did the leak reach the ground?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l024","ordinal":342520,"en":"I can't come to you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l025","ordinal":342521,"en":"Son of a monster pig"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l026","ordinal":342522,"en":"Don't win by fighting"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l027","ordinal":342523,"en":"A red tongue that speaks in vain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l028","ordinal":342524,"en":"Our day is tied up,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l029","ordinal":342525,"en":"If I put it with sarybay,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l030","ordinal":342526,"en":"He did not reach Sarybay,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l031","ordinal":342527,"en":"Your eyes are closed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0636:b003:l032","ordinal":342528,"en":"Your bones are limp,"}]
